\section{Order zero}{
The polynomials satisfy
\eqn{\int_{-1}^{1} P_m P_n \,\mathrm{d}t = 2\delta_{mn}/(2n+1)}, so on
\eqn{[\ell, u]} the matrix is diagonal with entries
\eqn{(u - \ell)/(2n+1)}. It is written directly and costs nothing.
